ipate in  corporate change and design meetings and  you might be involved with the  architects or design meetings where your  input might be taken so let's have a  look at someone with six years of  experience with regard to their salary  and work experience expectations now in  the US a salary is around $100,000 per  annum and in India the salary is around  fourteen hundred thousand INR per  expert level work is expected at this  level and no training is provided for  most of the work you'll be concentrating  on chef puppet and ansible and you  wouldn't be working to fix production  issues you'll be working to get it  things automated and solve day-to-day  issues of the dev team you will provide  remedies and suggest new technologies  you'll also be required to work on  scripting in Python or shell and you  will be required to automate application  deployments and set up continuous  delivery and continuous integration  pipelines you'll also be required to set  up monitoring and logging systems and  you'll be required to know Linux  debugging in depth so you should know  how Linux works and how to debug  production issues in Linux now for  someone who has more than ten years  experience the salary in the US would be  a hundred and thirty thousand per annum  and in India 20 hundred thousand INR per  annum these are just ballpark figures  for someone with this much experience  salary is really based on negotiation if  you have more certifications or if you  have if you know more tools like if  you're an expert in Python chef or Ruby  you can get up to 150 thousand in the US  and twenty five or thirty or even more  in India at this level architecture and  design level work is expected out of you  and you should suggest how to architect  stuff solution architecture is also  expected because a client may want to  implement a new solution and you would  be required to give your input there you  will be mentoring and leading teams of  six or seven people at this stage you'